.TH AOCCTL 1 "2026-11-08" "acer-open-control 0.2.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
aocctl \- control fans, keyboard light and firmware features (AcerOpenControl)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aocctl
.I command
.RI [ args ]
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B status \fR[\fB\-\-json\fR]
Temperatures, fan speeds, mode and feature state.
.TP
.BI mode " auto|silent|balanced|performance|max|custom"
Set the fan mode.
.TP
.BR curve " [\fITEMP:DUTY\fR ...]"
Show or set the custom fan curve.
.TP
.B kbd \fR[\fB\-\-color\fR \fIRRGGBB|name\fR] [\fB\-\-brightness\fR \fI0..255|off\fR]
Keyboard backlight.
.TP
.BI profile " key|bios"
Firmware performance profile.
.TP
.BR charge " \fIstop\fR|off [\fB\-\-start\fR \fIpercent\fR]"
Battery charge limit.
.TP
.BR webcam " on|off"
Webcam power.
.TP
.B model
Matched model profile and capabilities.
.TP
.B reapply
Resend all settings (used after resume).
.TP
.B restore\-auto
Hand fans back to the BIOS without the daemon (root).
.TP
.BR probe " fans|features|keys"
Hardware probes for creating a profile for a new model (root).
.TP
.BR profiles " list|check \fIfile\fR|generate [\fIdir\fR]"
Model profile tools.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR aocd (8),
/usr/share/doc/acer-open-control/USAGE.md
